stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: start (subject locks acquired)
    PENDING --> RUNNING: executor claims run
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: step succeeded or no-op, next step
    RUNNING --> WAITING_RETRY: transient failure, attempts left
    WAITING_RETRY --> RUNNING: next_attempt_at reached
    RUNNING --> PAUSED: retries exhausted or permanent error
    PAUSED --> RUNNING: operator retry or skip
    PAUSED --> ROLLING_BACK: operator rollback
    PAUSED --> ABANDONED: operator abandon
    RUNNING --> ROLLING_BACK: auto-rollback policy
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: cancel requested, between steps
    RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED: last step done
    SUCCEEDED --> ROLLING_BACK: user-requested revert
    ROLLING_BACK --> ROLLED_BACK: all rollbacks done
    ROLLING_BACK --> ROLLBACK_FAILED: rollback retries exhausted
    ROLLBACK_FAILED --> ROLLING_BACK: operator retry
    ROLLBACK_FAILED --> ABANDONED: operator abandon
    SUCCEEDED --> [*]
    ROLLED_BACK --> [*]
    ABANDONED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
